flowchart TB
    subgraph ACQUIRE[1. Acquire]
        direction LR
        CONFIG[Configured organisation scope]
        CATALOGUE[Organisation-scoped catalogue]
        UPCOMING[Upcoming feed]
        PAST[Past feed]
        PAGINATION[Parallel bounded pagination<br/>Maximum 50 records per page<br/>Maximum 20 pages per feed]
    end

    subgraph TRUST[2. Trust boundary]
        direction LR
        LIMITS[Eight-second timeout<br/>Two MiB response limit]
        SCHEMA[Runtime schema and pagination validation]
        PUBLIC_CONTRACT[Admit only the public event contract]
    end

    subgraph NORMALISE[3. Privacy-filtered normalisation]
        direction LR
        FILTER[Strip provider-only and unsupported fields]
        HKT[Convert timestamps explicitly to HKT +08:00]
        LINKS[Generate canonical HTTPS registration links]
        DEDUP[Deduplicate by event ID]
        SORT[Sort deterministically]
        CACHE[Five-minute normalised cache]
    end

    subgraph DERIVE[4. Derive and present]
        direction LR
        PHASE[Exact temporal phase]
        CALENDAR[Occupied Hong Kong calendar bucket]
        CATEGORIES[Deterministic confirmed categories]
        DISPLAY[Display order, filters and CTA]
        UI[Homepage and programme UI]
    end

    FALLBACK{Provider request fails}
    WARM{Valid warm snapshot exists}
    COLD[Honest unavailable state]
    BOOKING[Canonical The Ground booking hand-off]

    CONFIG --> CATALOGUE
    CATALOGUE --> UPCOMING
    CATALOGUE --> PAST
    UPCOMING --> PAGINATION
    PAST --> PAGINATION
    PAGINATION --> LIMITS
    LIMITS --> SCHEMA
    SCHEMA --> PUBLIC_CONTRACT
    PUBLIC_CONTRACT --> FILTER
    FILTER --> HKT
    HKT --> LINKS
    LINKS --> DEDUP
    DEDUP --> SORT
    SORT --> CACHE

    CACHE --> PHASE
    CACHE --> CALENDAR
    CACHE --> CATEGORIES
    PHASE --> DISPLAY
    CALENDAR --> DISPLAY
    CATEGORIES --> DISPLAY
    DISPLAY --> UI
    UI --> BOOKING

    PAGINATION -.->|Network, schema or limit failure| FALLBACK
    FALLBACK --> WARM
    WARM -->|Yes, use last valid snapshot| CACHE
    WARM -.->|No snapshot| COLD
    COLD -.->|Direct The Ground link| BOOKING

    classDef acquire fill:#e4f1f7,stroke:#356a7d,color:#16333d
    classDef trust fill:#f7eadf,stroke:#8a5834,color:#442a18
    classDef normalise fill:#f0eef5,stroke:#675b79,color:#312a3a
    classDef derive fill:#eaf4e1,stroke:#48633c,color:#20301b
    classDef failure fill:#f9e4e4,stroke:#8b4545,color:#421f1f
    class CONFIG,CATALOGUE,UPCOMING,PAST,PAGINATION acquire
    class LIMITS,SCHEMA,PUBLIC_CONTRACT trust
    class FILTER,HKT,LINKS,DEDUP,SORT,CACHE normalise
    class PHASE,CALENDAR,CATEGORIES,DISPLAY,UI,BOOKING derive
    class FALLBACK,WARM,COLD failure
